#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:10 2895283f7a5d48b8bd61a3b73ef70c96
msgid ""
"ArduPilot capabilities can be extended with `ROS <http://www.ros2.org/>`__ "
"(aka Robot Operating System)."
msgstr "ArduPilot 的功能可以通过 `ROS <http://www.ros2.org/>`__ （即机器人操作系统）进行扩展。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:14 3ff05a357fb44a89a8f1f94370cd9348
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:16 325af68a9a0a41cfbe82d03feb26241e
msgid ""
"Before using ArduPilot with ROS, you should first be familiar with both "
"ArduPilot and ROS before trying to integrate them together."
msgstr "在将 ArduPilot 与 ROS 结合使用之前，应先分别熟悉 ArduPilot 和 ROS，再尝试将二者集成。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:18 932f5cb6b7724c55a2b71d83b4eb8972
msgid ""
"Learn how to use ArduPilot first by following the relevant wiki for `Rover "
"<https://ardupilot.org/rover/index.html>`__, `Copter "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/index.html>`__ or `Plane "
"<https://ardupilot.org/plane/index.html>`__. In particular, make sure the "
"vehicle works well in Manual and Autonomous modes like Guided and Auto "
"before trying to use ROS."
msgstr ""
"首先通过相关 wiki 学习 ArduPilot 的使用方法：`Rover "
"<https://ardupilot.org/rover/index.html>`__、`Copter "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/index.html>`__ 或 `Plane "
"<https://ardupilot.org/plane/index.html>`__。特别是要确保飞行器在 Manual 和 Guided、Auto "
"等自主模式下工作正常，然后再尝试使用 ROS。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:19 399728a39b5a45c19804af4df777fd7c
msgid ""
"Learn how to use ROS by reading the `ROS 2 tutorials "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials.html#>`__.  In the case of a "
"problem with ROS, it is best to ask on ROS community forums or `Robotics "
"Stack Exchange <https://robotics.stackexchange.com/>`__ first (or google "
"your error). You will find many other tutorials about ROS like `Emlid "
"<https://docs.emlid.com/navio2/ros>`__."
msgstr ""
"请阅读 `ROS 2 教程 <https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials.html#>`__ 学习如何使用 "
"ROS。遇到 ROS 问题时，最好先在 ROS 社区论坛或 `Robotics Stack Exchange "
"<https://robotics.stackexchange.com/>`__ 提问（或搜索您的错误信息）。您还可以找到许多其他 ROS 教程，例如 "
"`Emlid <https://docs.emlid.com/navio2/ros>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:38 10de8227a5c34d39ba0ee41cf6783049
msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr "总结"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:40 b3f9087aa9894908831917e72ddd8d28
msgid ""
"ROS is capable of extending autopilot capabilities with a wider ecosystem of"
" technologies that can run on more powerful computers."
msgstr "ROS 能够借助可在更强大计算机上运行的更广泛技术生态系统来扩展自驾仪的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:42 41d054c9a30f4cea8d66b87cb2968a3e
msgid ""
"Here is ArduPilot Rover performing path planning around objects using ROS "
"navigation."
msgstr "以下展示了 ArduPilot Rover 使用 ROS 导航模块进行绕障路径规划的示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:47 4dd42a98d347402da15ae3c35afea2d1
msgid ""
"We are keen to improve ArduPilot's support of ROS so if you find issues "
"(such as commands that do not seem to be supported), please report them in "
"the `ArduPilot issues list "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ with a title that "
"includes \"ROS\" and we will attempt to resolve them as quickly as possible."
msgstr ""
"我们致力于改进 ArduPilot 对 ROS 的支持，若发现问题（如似乎不支持的命令），请在 `ArduPilot 问题列表 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ 中提交，标题包含「ROS」，我们将尽快解决。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`ROS <http://www.ros.org/>`__ provides libraries, tools, hardware "
#~ "abstraction, device drivers, visualizers, message-passing, package "
#~ "management, and more to help software developers create robot applications. "
#~ "ROS has been superseded by `ROS2 "
#~ "<http://design.ros2.org/articles/why_ros2.html>`__, and ArduPilot now "
#~ "natively supports it through its library `AP_DDS "
#~ "<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_DDS>`__."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`ROS <http://www.ros.org/>`__ "
#~ "提供库、工具、硬件抽象、设备驱动、可视化工具、消息传递、包管理等功能，帮助软件开发者创建机器人应用程序。ROS 已被 `ROS 2 "
#~ "<http://design.ros2.org/articles/why_ros2.html>`__ 所取代，ArduPilot 现通过其库 "
#~ "`AP_DDS "
#~ "<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_DDS>`__ "
#~ "原生支持 ROS 2。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "In particular, make sure the vehicle works well in Manual and Autonomous "
#~ "modes like Guided and Auto before trying to use ROS."
#~ msgstr "尤其要确保飞行器在手动模式以及 Guided、Auto 等自主模式下工作正常，再尝试使用 ROS。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "First, make sure that you have successfully installed `ROS 2 Humble "
#~ "<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Installation.html>`__ . Currently, ROS 2 "
#~ "Humble is the only version supported."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "首先，确保已成功安装 `ROS 2 Humble "
#~ "<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Installation.html>`__。目前仅支持 ROS 2 Humble 版本。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You are about to create a new `ROS 2 workspace "
#~ "<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Beginner-Client-"
#~ "Libraries/Creating-A-Workspace/Creating-A-Workspace.html#id4>`__. This page "
#~ "assumes that your workspace is named `ardu_ws` in your home directory, but "
#~ "feel free to adjust to your preferred location."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "您即将创建一个新的 `ROS 2 工作空间 <https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Beginner-"
#~ "Client-Libraries/Creating-A-Workspace/Creating-A-"
#~ "Workspace.html#id4>`__。本页假设工作空间名为 `ardu_ws`，位于主目录下，您可以根据个人偏好调整位置。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Before anything else, make sure that you have `sourced your ROS 2 "
#~ "environment <https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-"
#~ "Tools/Configuring-ROS2-Environment.html#source-the-setup-files>`__ and check"
#~ " if it is `configured correctly "
#~ "<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Configuring-"
#~ "ROS2-Environment.html#check-environment-variables>`__."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "在进行任何操作之前，请确保已 `激活 ROS 2 环境 "
#~ "<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Configuring-"
#~ "ROS2-Environment.html#source-the-setup-files>`__ 并检查是否 `配置正确 "
#~ "<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Configuring-"
#~ "ROS2-Environment.html#check-environment-variables>`__。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Finally, ensure you have `set up your ArduPilot build environment "
#~ "<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/building-the-code.html#setting-up-the-build-"
#~ "environment>`__."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "最后，确保已 `配置好 ArduPilot 构建环境 <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/building-the-"
#~ "code.html#setting-up-the-build-environment>`__。"

